      "text": "Legend fragment of the map in Figure 4.1 on hepatitis B birth-dose vaccination, with categories: Yes, throughout the country (text cropped); Yes, in certain regions; Yes, only in risk groups; Planned; Not administered; No data; and Not applicable. The map itself is not included.",
